{"title":"긍지 높은 아이돌","artist":"Honeyworks","sourceId":"reference:Nojh9TaOFwoLFE4eGtp2","sourceHash":"8482f88bc78b2adc5daa05f15111e435a5aa59b1de834066566eb3d06d2014e2","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":30288562,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":23.03,"end":25.78,"text":"私のこと知ってますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":25.78,"end":28.76,"text":"可愛く見えてますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":28.76,"end":31.92,"text":"私の歌どうだろうな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":31.92,"end":34.47,"text":"うまく歌えてますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":34.47,"end":37.32,"text":"衣装だとかメイクだとか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":37.32,"end":40.16,"text":"可愛く見えてますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":40.16,"end":43.3,"text":"振り付けとかファンサとかも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":43.3,"end":46.37,"text":"喜んでもらえますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":46.37,"end":52.83,"text":"手は冷たくなって 足は震える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":52.83,"end":56.96,"text":"それでも戦いたい アイドルだから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":56.96,"end":60.66,"text":"バカにするやつは嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":60.66,"end":63.71,"text":"見下されるのも嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":63.71,"end":66.09,"text":"\"アイドルなんか\" という言葉を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":66.09,"end":69.13,"text":"見てもいないくせに言うな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":69.13,"end":72.32,"text":"頑張りを当然と言うな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":72.32,"end":75.17,"text":"イメージとか強制するな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":75.17,"end":78.12,"text":"\"アイドルなんか\" という言葉は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":78.12,"end":92.33,"text":"この世で一番大嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":92.33,"end":95.34,"text":"プライベート 見えないから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":95.34,"end":97.83,"text":"分からないと思います","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":97.83,"end":101.39,"text":"性格とか 悪い方です","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":101.39,"end":104.49000000000001,"text":"騙しちゃっていますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":104.49000000000001,"end":106.78999999999999,"text":"でも本気です 本気なんです","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":106.78999999999999,"end":109.75999999999999,"text":"ありのままの私を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":109.75999999999999,"end":112.66,"text":"好きになって 推して下さい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":112.66,"end":115.72999999999999,"text":"それってワガママですか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":115.72999999999999,"end":121.74,"text":"きっと可愛くない 全部わかってる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":121.74,"end":127.54,"text":"それでも好かれてたい アイドルだから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":127.54,"end":130.13,"text":"皮肉 言う奴は嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":130.13,"end":132.68,"text":"言い訳ばかりも嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":132.68,"end":135.78,"text":"\"こんなもんか\" という言葉を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":135.78,"end":138.4,"text":"軽々しく口にするな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":138.4,"end":141.74,"text":"勝手に限界決めるな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":141.74,"end":144.4,"text":"笑いものになんてするな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":144.4,"end":147.98,"text":"\"アイドルなんか\" という言葉は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":147.98,"end":151.06,"text":"この世で一番大嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":151.06,"end":153.07,"text":"向かい風を切り裂け","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":153.07,"end":161.37,"text":"誇り高きアイドル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":161.37,"end":167.73,"text":"目指そうぜ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":167.73,"end":170.8,"text":"応援がなければ 活動出来ない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":170.8,"end":174.13,"text":"好きな事ばかりじゃ 生きては行けない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":174.13,"end":176.4,"text":"元気あげるはずが もらってばかりだし","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":176.4,"end":190.72,"text":"恩返しできる日まで 待ってて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":190.72,"end":193.83,"text":"歓声が減っても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":193.83,"end":196.84,"text":"飽きられちゃっても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":196.84,"end":199.54,"text":"それでも笑っていたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":199.54,"end":202.51,"text":"アイドルだから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":202.51,"end":205.06,"text":"熱いファンの愛があって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":205.06,"end":208.07999999999998,"text":"スタッフさんの愛があって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":208.07999999999998,"end":210.76,"text":"いつも家族の愛があって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":210.76,"end":214.09,"text":"生きてる アイドル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":214.09,"end":217.07,"text":"バカにするやつは嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":217.07,"end":219.95,"text":"見下されるのも嫌いだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":219.95,"end":222.57999999999998,"text":"\"アイドルなんか\" という言葉を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":222.57999999999998,"end":225.14,"text":"見てもいないくせに言うな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":225.14,"end":228.12,"text":"頑張りを当然と言うな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":228.12,"end":231.12,"text":"イメージとか強制するな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":231.12,"end":234.38,"text":"\"アイドルなんか\" という言葉は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":234.38,"end":238.17000000000002,"text":"この世でいちばん大嫌いだ",